        {"zh": "骨头是空的，很轻", "en": "My bones are hollow and light."},
        {"zh": "我从你头顶擦过", "en": "I passed just over your head."},
        {"zh": "你被翅膀扫了一下", "en": "My wing brushed you."},
        {"zh": "我退到崖边", "en": "I back to the cliff edge."},
        {"zh": "我的翼膜刮到你，差点失速。", "en": "My wing membrane grazes you and I nearly stall."},
        {"zh": "我在沙滩上跑不快", "en": "I cannot run well on sand."},
        {"zh": "别抓住我的翼", "en": "Do not grab my wing."}
      ]
