        {"zh": "我的翼晒得很暖", "en": "My wings are warm from the sun."},
        {"zh": "巢要建在石缝里", "en": "The nest goes in a rock crack."},
        {"zh": "很快就要收翅", "en": "We will fold our wings soon."},
        {"zh": "你别靠近崖边", "en": "Do not come near the edge."},
        {"zh": "潮水的声音盖过一切", "en": "The tide covers every sound."},
        {"zh": "我们各自飞走", "en": "We each fly off."}
